<title>USA: Merrill Lynch, Mobil offer business planning.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch, Mobil offer business planning.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, N.J. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc said Monday it formed a unique alliance with Mobil Corp in which Merrill Lynch is offering business financial planning and access to business financing to Mobil's 7,700 U.S. dealers and distributors.</p>
<p>The program, titled &quot;The Mobil Franchisee Financial Management and Performance Analysis Program&quot;, is based on Merrill Lynch's financial planning tools, the Financial Foundation Service for individuals and the Business Financial Planner for businesses, the firm said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
